# docs/demo-teaser.tape — ~30s GIF of the money shot (webhook wake)
# for embedding in the README / social posts.

Output docs/demo-teaser.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 620
Set Padding 22
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "TEASER=1 ./docs/demo-play.sh"
Show
Enter
Sleep 32s
